  "description": "Sha Hu Rong is looking for a special talent: a traditional Korean dancer whose movements are so effortless and elegant, he glides across the stage like a bird. Like a snake on the hunt, Sha Hu Rong finds his talent working at a coffee shop. Unfortunately, while Yoo Chung’s twin brother might still have some dream of stardom, somewhere along the line Yoo Chung gave up the stage. But a figure not dissimilar to Sha Hu Rong has been haunting Yoo Chung’s dreams, lately… and it seems the snake is never too far from the bird it hunts. \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
